"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:87","key":{"work_id":978100034,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":978100034,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":978300019,"text":"Rachel Carson onderzoekt de gevolgen van chemische bestrijdingsmiddelen voor natuur en gezondheid. Ze opent met een verbeeld Amerikaans stadje waar het verdwijnen van dieren en onbekende ziekten het dagelijks leven ontregelen. Van daaruit kijkt ze naar de schade die middelen als DDT kunnen aanrichten. Haar betoog bevraagt het idee dat technische beheersing van ongedierte los kan worden gezien van de samenhang binnen een leefomgeving.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bibliografische bron; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1571699/verstild-voorjaar.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1571699/verstild-voorjaar.html","sha256":"6ede8c89b831fca983ce93307b617de003165330d3d6012f49e9ed88b0844be4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:46:34.806Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789025314675 verschijningsdatum 13/12/2022 NUR 320 Literaire non-fictie algemeen imprint Athenaeum uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Rachel Carson"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1571699/verstild-voorjaar.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","fact":"Work-bound content reviewed; original factual Dutch summary, not source quotation or title-derived content."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789049801595","key":{"id":978200132},"before":null,"after":{"id":978200132,"title":"Zwaarden, paarden en ziektekiemen","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789049801595","work_id":978100035,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Uitgeverij Dwarsligger®","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789049801595","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789049801595"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789049801595","work_id":978100035,"bound_author_id":978300020,"bound_title":"Zwaarden, paarden en ziektekiemen","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789049801595","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000004065_Zwaarden_paarden_en_ziektekiemen_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24833/zwaarden-paarden-en-ziektekiemen.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24833/zwaarden-paarden-en-ziektekiemen.html","sha256":"8481ee290fb1a08544f2b3688589e946b131351d4df8c3588cd23d9854562aa4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:41:54.194Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789049801595 verschijningsdatum 01/04/2012 NUR 680 Geschiedenis algemeen uitgever Uitgeverij Dwarsligger® taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Jared Diamond"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000004065_Zwaarden_paarden_en_ziektekiemen_0_0.jpg","sha256":"9f362bb7f162d6d52a9dcca177eefc0d605e3c9d30e4dc0926ca3bf25f4dfd5c","bytes":87564,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:23:05.501Z","fact":"Exact edition block and human visual review; same observed provider image stem for medium variant."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:89","key":{"work_id":978100035,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":978100035,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":978300020,"text":"Jared Diamond vraagt waarom menselijke samenlevingen zich zo verschillend hebben ontwikkeld. Hij zoekt verklaringen voor ongelijke machtsverhoudingen niet in een aangeboren verschil tussen volkeren, maar in omstandigheden zoals klimaat en ziektekiemen. Het boek verbindt die vraag met de grote lijnen van de wereldgeschiedenis. Zo onderzoekt Diamond hoe geografische en biologische factoren de mogelijkheden van mensen beïnvloeden en hoe toevallige uitgangsposities langdurige gevolgen kunnen krijgen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bibliografische bron; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24833/zwaarden-paarden-en-ziektekiemen.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24833/zwaarden-paarden-en-ziektekiemen.html","sha256":"8481ee290fb1a08544f2b3688589e946b131351d4df8c3588cd23d9854562aa4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:41:54.194Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789049801595 verschijningsdatum 01/04/2012 NUR 680 Geschiedenis algemeen uitgever Uitgeverij Dwarsligger® taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Jared Diamond"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24833/zwaarden-paarden-en-ziektekiemen.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","fact":"Work-bound content reviewed; original factual Dutch summary, not source quotation or title-derived content."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789041714398","key":{"id":978200133},"before":null,"after":{"id":978200133,"title":"Het glazen kasteel","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789041714398","work_id":978100036,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Rainbow","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789041714398","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789041714398"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789041714398","work_id":978100036,"bound_author_id":978300021,"bound_title":"Het glazen kasteel","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789041714398","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000469829_Het_glazen_kasteel_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1183162/het-glazen-kasteel.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://meta